From: Brady <brady@aioscilloscope.com>
Subject: input: edt-ft5x06: "focaltech,ft5422", a FocalTech-firmware part identified by its chip id (6.12)
Copyright (C) 2026 Olympian LED, Inc.

Add a "focaltech,ft5422" compatible for FocalTech touch controllers that run
FocalTech's own firmware. Such a part is identified by FocalTech's chip id
registers (0xa3 and 0x9f, retried as the part comes out of reset) instead of
the EDT model string, whose registers mean something else on FocalTech
firmware and could swap the axes or select the wrong protocol. The EDT
tuning registers, which FocalTech parts do not have, are never read or
written, so the driver's only write to the part is the hibernate command on
suspend. Every other compatible behaves as before; the binding gains the
compatible.

---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/edt-ft5x06.yaml
